  "worked_solution": "First, we add a column for $\u00acQ,$ where the truth values are opposite to the corresponding values in the column for $Q.$ \n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,\u00acQ\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for $P\u2227\u00acQ.$ Remember that $P\u2227\u00acQ$ is true if both $P$ and $\u00acQ$ are true. \n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,\u00acQ\\,$ | $\\,P\u2227\u00acQ\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for $\u00ac(P\u2227\u00acQ).$ Remember that the truth values of $\u00ac(P\u2227\u00acQ)$ are opposite those of $P\u2227\u00acQ.$ \n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,\u00acQ\\,$ | $\\,P\u2227\u00acQ\\,$ | $\\,\u00ac(P\u2227\u00acQ)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |",
